# Cursor AI Rules — Lucky's Learning World

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `DEVELOPMENT_RULES.md` before making any code modifications.
- Every task begins with Acceptance Criteria in `tasks/TASK-XXX.md` and `ACCEPTANCE_CRITERIA.md`.
- Automated test files under `tests/*.test.mjs` must include `// @task TASK-XXX` and `// @ac AC-Y.Z` tags.
- Run `npm run test:coverage:gate` to verify changes before completing work.
- Zero-Build Vanilla JS (`import`/`export`) architecture required.
